# Patient-level clinical data. The raw dataset and any full per-patient
# extract must never be published to a public repo — only aggregate
# tables, figures, metadata, and the trained model artifacts derived from
# them are safe to share. See reports/dataset_audit.md.
Resource files/Heart_diasease_dataset_from_Northern_Bangladesh.xlsx
Resource files/northern_bangladesh_heart_disease_artifacts/RESTRICTED_modelling_dataset.csv

# Notebook working state: pickled model objects and train/test splits.
# Regenerable from the notebooks themselves; large and some contain full
# per-patient rows, so they don't belong in the repo either.
notebooks/*.pkl
notebooks/*.npy
